---
<BaseLayout title="Image Compressor Online — Shrink JPG PNG and WebP in Your Browser" description={description} canonical="https://deskutil.com/converters/image-compressor/" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
<div class="shell breadcrumbs"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/converters/">Converters</a></li><li aria-current="page">Image Compressor</li></ol></nav></div>
<section class="shell page-heading tool-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Converter tool</p><h1>Image Compressor</h1><p>Shrink a JPG, PNG, or WebP image in your browser. The file is drawn on a canvas, then exported as a <strong>lossy JPEG</strong> or as PNG if you pick PNG output. Compare original vs new size, then download. Nothing is uploaded. HEIC is not this tool.</p>
<div class="tool-panel"><div class="tool-topbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Image Compressor actions"><button class="tool-button primary" id="compress" type="button">Compress image</button><button class="tool-button" id="download" type="button" disabled>Download</button><span class="privacy-note">Processed only in your browser</span></div>
<p class="tool-note">This is a lossy JPEG redraw of your image on a canvas. It is not a lossless optimizer. PNG output is a PNG of that same redraw. HEIC is not supported. Nothing is uploaded.</p>
<div class="file-drop" id="drop-zone"><div class="file-drop-inner"><label class="tool-check" for="image-file">Image file</label><input class="field-input" id="image-file" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp" /><p class="file-meta" id="file-meta">Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP file, or drop it here. Nothing is uploaded.</p></div></div>
<div class="tool-fields">
<div class="tool-field"><label for="jpg-quality">JPEG quality: <span id="quality-label">72%</span></label><input class="field-range" id="jpg-quality" type="range" min="50" max="92" value="72" /></div>
<div class="tool-field"><label for="out-format">Output format</label><select class="field-input" id="out-format"><option value="jpeg">JPEG (lossy)</option><option value="png">PNG</option></select></div>
</div>
<div class="finance-grid">
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Original size</span><strong id="out-original">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>New size</span><strong id="out-new">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Change</span><strong id="out-change">—</strong></div>
<div class="finance-stat"><span>Dimensions</span><strong id="out-dims">—</strong></div>
</div>
<p class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP image, set quality, then compress. HEIC is not supported.</p></div>
<div class="content-grid"><article class="prose"><h2>How to use Image Compressor</h2><p>Choose or drop one JPG, PNG, or WebP file. Set JPEG quality (about 50% to 92%) if you want JPEG output, or pick PNG. Then <strong>Compress image</strong>. The tool draws the picture on a canvas and exports it again. Compare original size vs new size, then download. HEIC files are rejected. Nothing is sent to a server.</p>
<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>How does Image Compressor shrink files?</h3><p>It draws your image onto a canvas and exports it again. JPEG output is lossy: quality is the JPEG encoder setting, not a lossless optimizer. PNG output is a PNG of that same redrawn canvas, not a specialized PNG compressor.</p>
<h3>Is my image uploaded to a server?</h3><p>No. The file stays on your device. Canvas encoding runs in your browser and Deskutil never receives the image.</p>
<h3>Does this support HEIC?</h3><p>No. This tool accepts JPG, PNG, and WebP only. HEIC belongs to a later tool.</p>
<h3>Will every image get smaller?</h3><p>Not always. An already-small JPEG may stay similar in size or even grow slightly after a redraw. Lower the quality slider for JPEG if you still need a smaller file. PNG output is often larger than a well-compressed JPEG.</p>
<h3>What file do I download?</h3><p>One compressed image. JPEG output uses a .jpg name. PNG output uses a .png name. Original vs new size is shown before you download. Nothing is uploaded.</p></article>
<aside class="aside-card"><h2>Explore Deskutil</h2><ul><li><a href="/converters/">Converter tools</a></li><li><a href="/converters/jpg-to-pdf/">JPG to PDF</a></li><li><a href="/converters/compress-pdf/">Compress PDF</a></li><li><a href="/converters/pdf-to-jpg/">PDF to JPG</a></li><li><a href="/privacy/">How privacy works</a></li></ul></aside></div></section>
<script>
const WARN_BYTES=15*1024*1024;
const MAX_BYTES=40*1024*1024;
const MAX_EDGE=8192;
let sourceFile:File|null=null;
let resultUrl='';
let resultName='compressed.jpg';
const fileInput=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#image-file')!;
const dropZone=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#drop-zone')!;
const fileMeta=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#file-meta')!;
const quality=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#jpg-quality')!;
const qualityLabel=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#quality-label')!;
const outFormat=document.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('#out-format')!;
const outOriginal=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-original')!;
const outNew=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-new')!;
const outChange=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-change')!;
const outDims=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#out-dims')!;
const compressBtn=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#compress')!;
const downloadBtn=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#download')!;
const status=document.querySelector<HTMLParagraphElement>('#status')!;
const setStatus=(message:string,kind='')=>{status.textContent=message;status.className=('status '+kind).trim()};
const kb=(n:number)=>n>=1048576?(n/1048576).toFixed(2)+' MB':Math.round(n/1024)+' KB';
const extOf=(name:string)=>{const i=name.lastIndexOf('.');return i>=0?name.slice(i+1).toLowerCase():''};
const isHeic=(file:File)=>{const t=file.type.toLowerCase();const e=extOf(file.name);return t.includes('heic')||t.includes('heif')||e==='heic'||e==='heif'};
const kindOf=(file:File):'jpeg'|'png'|'webp'|null=>{
  const t=file.type.toLowerCase();
  const e=extOf(file.name);
  if(t==='image/jpeg'||t==='image/jpg'||e==='jpg'||e==='jpeg')return 'jpeg';
  if(t==='image/png'||e==='png')return 'png';
  if(t==='image/webp'||e==='webp')return 'webp';
  return null;
};
const resetOutput=()=>{if(resultUrl){URL.revokeObjectURL(resultUrl);resultUrl=''} downloadBtn.disabled=true; outOriginal.textContent='—'; outNew.textContent='—'; outChange.textContent='—'; outDims.textContent='—';};
const setFile=(file:File|null)=>{
  resetOutput();
  sourceFile=file;
  if(!file){fileMeta.textContent='Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP file, or drop it here. Nothing is uploaded.';return}
  fileMeta.textContent=file.name+' ('+kb(file.size)+'). Work stays in the browser.';
  outOriginal.textContent=kb(file.size);
};
quality.addEventListener('input',()=>{qualityLabel.textContent=quality.value+'%';});
fileInput.addEventListener('change',()=>{
  const file=fileInput.files&&fileInput.files[0];
  if(!file)return;
  if(isHeic(file)){setFile(null);fileInput.value='';setStatus('HEIC is not this tool. Use JPG, PNG, or WebP.','error');return}
  if(!kindOf(file)){setFile(null);fileInput.value='';setStatus('Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP file.','error');return}
  setFile(file);
  const note=file.size>WARN_BYTES?' Large images may be slow.':'';
  setStatus(file.name+' ready.'+note);
});
['dragenter','dragover'].forEach((eventName)=>dropZone.addEventListener(eventName,(event)=>{event.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.add('drag')}));
['dragleave','drop'].forEach((eventName)=>dropZone.addEventListener(eventName,(event)=>{event.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.remove('drag')}));
dropZone.addEventListener('drop',(event)=>{
  const files=event.dataTransfer&&event.dataTransfer.files;
  if(!files||!files.length)return;
  const file=files[0];
  fileInput.value='';
  if(isHeic(file)){setFile(null);setStatus('HEIC is not this tool. Use JPG, PNG, or WebP.','error');return}
  if(!kindOf(file)){setFile(null);setStatus('Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP file.','error');return}
  setFile(file);
  const note=file.size>WARN_BYTES?' Large images may be slow.':'';
  setStatus(file.name+' ready.'+note);
});
const stemOf=(name:string)=>{const i=name.lastIndexOf('.');return (i>0?name.slice(0,i):name)||'image'};
compressBtn.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
  compressBtn.disabled=true;
  try{
    if(!sourceFile)throw new Error('Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP image first.');
    if(isHeic(sourceFile))throw new Error('HEIC is not this tool. Use JPG, PNG, or WebP.');
    if(!kindOf(sourceFile))throw new Error('Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP file.');
    if(sourceFile.size>MAX_BYTES)throw new Error('This image is over 40 MB. Use a smaller file.');
    setStatus('Drawing image to canvas...');
    let bitmap:ImageBitmap;
    try{bitmap=await createImageBitmap(sourceFile)}catch{throw new Error('Could not read that file. Use a standard JPG, PNG, or WebP image.')}
    if(bitmap.width>MAX_EDGE||bitmap.height>MAX_EDGE){bitmap.close();throw new Error('This image is over 8192 pixels on one side. Use a smaller image.')}
    const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');
    canvas.width=bitmap.width;
    canvas.height=bitmap.height;
    const pngOut=outFormat.value==='png';
    const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d',{alpha:pngOut});
    if(!ctx){bitmap.close();throw new Error('Could not prepare that image.');}
    if(!pngOut){ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.fillRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height)}
    ctx.drawImage(bitmap,0,0);
    const w=bitmap.width;
    const h=bitmap.height;
    bitmap.close();
    const q=Number(quality.value)/100;
    const mime=pngOut?'image/png':'image/jpeg';
    setStatus(pngOut?'Encoding PNG...':'Encoding JPEG at '+quality.value+'% quality...');
    const blob=await new Promise<Blob>((resolve,reject)=>canvas.toBlob((value)=>value?resolve(value):reject(new Error('Could not encode that image.')),mime,pngOut?undefined:q));
    if(resultUrl)URL.revokeObjectURL(resultUrl);
    resultUrl=URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    resultName=stemOf(sourceFile.name)+(pngOut?'.png':'.jpg');
    const orig=sourceFile.size;
    const next=blob.size;
    const delta=next-orig;
    const pct=orig?Math.round((delta/orig)*100):0;
    outOriginal.textContent=kb(orig);
    outNew.textContent=kb(next);
    outChange.textContent=(delta>0?'+':'')+kb(Math.abs(delta))+' ('+(pct>0?'+':'')+pct+'%)';
    outDims.textContent=w+' × '+h;
    downloadBtn.disabled=false;
    const grew=next>=orig;
    setStatus(grew?'Encoded '+resultName+'. Size did not drop. Try a lower JPEG quality, or keep PNG only if you need transparency. Nothing was uploaded.':'Compressed to '+resultName+'. Nothing was uploaded.','success');
  }catch(error){setStatus(error instanceof Error?error.message:'Could not compress that image.','error')}
  finally{compressBtn.disabled=false}
});
downloadBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
  if(!resultUrl)return;
  const link=document.createElement('a');
  link.href=resultUrl;link.download=resultName;link.click();
  setStatus('Downloaded '+resultName+'. Nothing was uploaded.','success');
});
</script></BaseLayout>
